1B118 Continuous mixers having all of the following (see List of Items Controlled), and "specially designed" "parts" and "components" therefor.
a. Capable of mixing under vacuum in the range of 13.326 kPa or less;
b. Capable of controlling mixing temperature in the range of 233 K (-40°C) to 373 K (100°C);
c. Capable of curing under vacuum;
d. Capable of continuously processing more than 30 kg per hour of composite propellant.
Technical Note: 1B118 controls equipment used in the manufacturing of composite solid propellants for missiles and rockets.
Reasons for Control: MT, AT

